"description":"Welcome to CareLinx by Sharecare\n\nWhether you're a senior seeking assistance with daily tasks, a family member searching for reliable support for a loved one, a health plan member looking to use your in-home care benefit, or a caring professional searching for fulfilling opportunities, the CareLinx app is here to streamline the process and ensure peace of mind. \n\nCareLinx is a nationwide, trusted network of tech-enabled caring professionals assisting members with home helper tasks, personal care needs, and clinical support.  \n\nCaregivers and healthcare professionals   \n- Find work that pays well and fits into your schedule \n- Search, manage, and apply for jobs from your mobile phone \n- Create an engaging professional profile  \n- Be notified instantly about new jobs, messages, and care plan reminders  \n- Sharpen your caregiving skills with professional online video courses  \n\nMembers, Individuals, and families looking for care  \n- Find the right caregiver match at an affordable rate \n- Post a job quickly, message caregivers directly, and get notified when they reply \n- Stay connected with real-time updates and free online classes \n- Review and pay invoices that transparently show all shifts, tasks completed, GPS-based clock-ins, and clock-outs \n- Avoid payroll and tax headaches — we’ll manage them for you \n\n\nAlready a CareLinx member? Simply log in to access your account. \n\nHave any problems, questions, or feedback? Call us at 1(800) 494-3106 or email support@carelinx.com.", "bundleId":"com.carelinx.ios", "averageUserRatingForCurrentVersion":4.4777500000000003410605131648480892181396484375, "sellerUrl":"https://www.carelinx.com/", "languageCodesISO2A":["EN"], "fileSizeBytes":"64342016", "formattedPrice":"Free", "userRatingCountForCurrentVersion":2045, "trackContentRating":"17+", "contentAdvisoryRating":"17+", "averageUserRating":4.4777500000000003410605131648480892181396484375, "trackCensoredName":"CareLinx: In-Home Care", "track